flowchart LR
    Core[Core canonical IR via existing Fixture] --> Export[Exact memberships and expected partition]
    Export --> Adapters[Framework-native construction and queries]
    Guard[Existing ProcessRunner and QuietHostGuard] --> Adapters
    Adapters --> Validate[Full partition or rank-vector/residual verification]
    Validate --> Timings[Explicitly authorized bounded measurements]
    Timings --> Report[Raw samples, provenance and PDF]
    Export --> Single[One immutable case per input file]
    Single --> Isolated[One framework per fresh process]
    Guard --> Isolated
    Isolated --> Memory[Runtime / graph / preparation / solve RSS and phase peaks]
    Memory --> Oracle[Full-vector verification after child exit]
    Oracle --> Report
    Adapters --> Observer[Optional same-call phase observer]
    Observer --> Partition[Incidence / preparation / solve-result / disposal]
    Partition --> Contract[Boundary and vector-parity tests]
    Core --> Operator[Shared ordered incidence contraction]
    Operator --> Power[Ordered power control]
    Operator --> Krylov[Existing Tensor GMRES]
    Power --> Certificate[Canonical L1 certification update]
    Krylov --> Certificate
    Certificate --> Guard
